+# Simulate the completion process
+# We want to complete the value for --input
+# The File type's shell_complete will be called.
+# Let's see if it opens the file.
+# Actually, click.File('r') will open the file when it's used as a parameter.
+# But in completion, we are not using it as a parameter, we are just completing it.
+
+# Let's try to use a custom type that opens a file in shell_complete
